# OMS → Shopify EDD sync

## Link
OMS row `OrderLineItemOperationalData` is keyed by `shop + orderId + variantId`
(= Shopify order + line variant). That link must stay intact.

## Current EDD (customer-facing)
When `eddDate` changes in OMS (single save or bulk):
1. Save to our DB first
2. **Await** `pushEddToShopify` → order metafield `containerdoor_ops.edd_{variantId}`
3. Customer Account extension also reads live OMS via `/api/order-status`

## Notes
Internal OMS notes / CommunicationLog notes **never** auto-sync to Shopify.
Only explicit “Add to Shopify order timeline” checkbox may write a staff note.

## Do not
- Fire-and-forget EDD as the only Shopify path (always await EDD push)
- Push the notes blob via `syncChangesToShopify`
